---
description: >-
  `usecase.curve` (D733, #1379) draws every relationship and note line, over the top-level
  `curve`: right angles here (`step`), where the default draws S-curves.
config:
  curve: linear
  usecase:
    curve: step
---
usecase-beta
    direction TB
    actor Customer("Customer")
    actor Admin("Administrator")
    Browse("Browse catalog")
    Checkout("Place order")
    Pay("Pay")
    Manage[Manage catalog]
    note for Pay "Card or invoice"
    Customer --> Browse
    Customer --> Checkout
    Checkout ..> : include Pay
    Admin --> Manage
    Admin --> Browse
